        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-GNT625SMTSBR, Garnet Series 4 Glass Shower Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Smooth Shower Door Pull comes with everything you need to mount a pair of pulls back-to-bak on your 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower door including 2 pulls and 2 sets of lock-down rosettes. The Traditional Smooth Glass Shower Door Pull Pair is available in 8 inch, 10 inch, and 12 inch lengths. Choose from a huge selection of finishes including satin nickel and polished chrome.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of First Impressions SD-GNT625SMTSBR Elegant Glass Shower Door Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 door pulls and includes all the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. </li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GNT04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262220\"><b>First Impressions SD-GNT625SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>SD-GNT625008SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>SD-GNT625010SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>SD-GNT625012SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</i>\r\n</p>",
